        </div>
        <aside class="note card">
          <strong>66 pp</strong>
          South Asia’s Q1–Q5 income spread is the steepest divide, while overall penetration is more than twice as high in Europe and North America as in Sub‑Saharan Africa and South Asia.
        </aside>
